OL,3,ABudget to include #1bn for social and
OL,4,Aaffordable housing
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than #1bn for social and
OL,7,Faffordable housing in England will be
OL,8,Fprovided in the Budget, taking funding
OL,9,Ffor the government's 10-year homes
OL,10,Fprogramme past #40bn.
OL,12,FMayors and regional leaders across
OL,13,FEngland are also expected to get
OL,14,Fgreater powers and funding in
OL,15,FWednesday's announcement - with
OL,16,Fcouncils helped to borrow money from
OL,17,Fthe government to invest in
OL,18,Fhouse-building through preferential
OL,19,Finterest rates.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,113,105,200,300,0,100
