OL,1,W5j 5Qw;j 5wsjj#5wsjs1ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%,.** %-,(,%,. (,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABudget to include #1bn for social and
OL,4,Aaffordable housing
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is hoped the plans will give
OL,7,Fregional leaders more flexibility and
OL,8,Fauthority over investment decisions.
OL,10,FChancellor John Healey said English
OL,11,Fcities and regions would get the "right
OL,12,Fto decide their own future", while
OL,13,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham said the
OL,14,Fplans were about shifting power to
OL,15,Fthose "who know their communities
OL,16,Fbest".
